This crate started from the server half (wprsd) of wprs,
https://github.com/wayland-transpositor/wprs, at upstream commit
12b864dc5b308e63edede4714f664afa88507fce, with pocketnix's spike patches
on top (the fork's ux branch at f1a4239ef0c3602e7f10d65f8c9d1c601aea9f7c:
damage-only commits, scroll detection, modifier-only key events,
fractional-scale-v1, data-control, popups constrained to their toplevel,
xdg-activation). wprs is Copyright 2024 Google LLC and licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE in this directory).

The wire format, connection handling and window model were replaced with
pocketnix's GUI protocol (docs/gui-protocol.md in the pocketnix repository).
Files derived from wprs keep its copyright header and say what changed.
